          "puzzle_graph_unlocks": "gallery",
          "puzzle_graph_note": "The gallery stair waits on flags 2 and 3 and the shutter cut (OT 4.4).",
          <%# VM-WIRE: flag 3 (out of the release service's container onto its host). %>
          "acceptsVms": [<%= j.(station.(3)[:vm]) %>],
          "flags": <%= station_flags.(3) %>,
          "hintOnlyFlags": <%= station_hints.(3) %>,
          "flagRewards": [
            { "type": "emit_event", "event_name": "flag_3_in", "description": "Flag 3: out of the release service onto its host" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_comment": "VM gating handoff B7 (puzzle chains R4 M1): flag 2's own find, on the release console's desk (map desk 9.7-12.1, y 2.5-3.7; console at 10.4, 3.0), so flag 2 can't be taken before its station. Strings are the Codes block's staging login (VM agent).",
