          "puzzle_graph_role": "key",
          "puzzle_graph_unlocks": "release_console"
        },
        {
          "_comment": "VM gating F12 (handoff B5 item 2): the release host's operator login, behind the power-room card (the hall is past the power room), so flag 3 needs this find. Position by the east racks (SD R4 d3); strings set by the VM plan.",
